Welcome to Bingux OS.

To install Bingux OS onto a disk (this erases the disk), run
`bingux-installer probe`, write a plan file, then run:
    sudo bingux-installer install --plan plan.json

For Wi-Fi, connect with the nmtui or nmcli utilities.
Ethernet and Wi-Fi networks should connect automatically.

The install notes are printed by the Installation_guide command.
